cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model in your work, please cite the paper below."
title: "MVLFireNet"
abstract: "A lightweight forest fire and smoke detector with a multi-granularity
  vision-language enhancement branch. The branch is used during training only and
  is discarded at inference, so the deployed model runs at 2.41 M parameters and
  6.8 GFLOPs while reaching 86.3% mAP@0.5 and 54.8% mAP@0.5:0.95 on FSDataset-VL."
